/-!
# Genuine holomorphic exterior cup on the original period tori

For every actual period-domain point, the unchanged native holomorphic
sheaf cup agrees with the coefficient wedge on actual closed native
Dolbeault representatives. Its value in the original Haar markings is
the positive determinant. The genuine exterior-square cup is therefore
an isomorphism, with its forward map equal to the original cup map.

The proof uses the actual Godement--Dolbeault total resolution, genuine
derivation lifts and both original partial-resolution comparison maps.
No product is defined by transporting it from a coordinate space, and
no cup nonvanishing or comparison compatibility is assumed.
-/
